<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-049-A habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.272486" lon="-120.904292"><name>SC26-049-A</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 11.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 83/100; not catch probability. Center 51 ft; nearby 46–84 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-032</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 125-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.2723519011797" lon="-120.90292797327844"/><trkpt lat="35.27193403421485" lon="-120.90309438187764"/><trkpt lat="35.27160019918177" lon="-120.90344311336325"/><trkpt lat="35.271401218157415" lon="-120.90392107617548"/><trkpt lat="35.271367383231436" lon="-120.90445550678115"/><trkpt lat="35.27150384537678" lon="-120.9049650461069"/><trkpt lat="35.27178983031216" lon="-120.90537212388011"/><trkpt lat="35.272181800704224" lon="-120.9056147665527"/><trkpt lat="35.27262008358167" lon="-120.9056560320052"/><trkpt lat="35.27303795443738" lon="-120.90548963480471"/><trkpt lat="35.2733717953782" lon="-120.90514090494553"/><trkpt lat="35.273570780866486" lon="-120.90466293303471"/><trkpt lat="35.273604616197694" lon="-120.90412848793525"/><trkpt lat="35.273468150161506" lon="-120.90361893721081"/><trkpt lat="35.27318215931837" lon="-120.90321185781116"/><trkpt lat="35.272790184462366" lon="-120.90296922423717"/><trkpt lat="35.2723519011797" lon="-120.90292797327844"/></trkseg></trk></gpx>
